--
Full symbolic execution of std::regex construction over libstdc++'s
<regex>.  Historically this passed in ~25s ONLY in heap layouts where
the _Compiler constructor body had been silently dropped (an
order-dependent tie between the in-class friend declaration of
make_shared and its namespace definition, whose unnamed parameter pack
the parser had spelled differently); with the front end now
deterministic and the body present, symex of the NFA compiler exceeds
30 minutes at --unwind 5.  The CORE conversion gate is in
test_conversion.desc.
